~ ork_start
do GameState.ork_start_attack.emit()
Ork (snarling): Grakh’tul… ur-nak! Zor bash krumak!
*The ork raises its weapon and steps closer.*

- [Attack] => ork_attack
- Try to calm him => ork_negotiate

~ ork_attack
do GameState.player_attack_villager.emit()
[wait=0.05]
do GameState.request_attack.emit()
do GameState.ork_attack.emit()
Ork (roaring): [wait:3] RAAAAGH! KRUM-TAK!!!
- [Continue Attack] => ork_continue_attack
- Try to calm him => ork_negotiate

~ ork_continue_attack
do GameState.player_attack_villager.emit()
[wait=0.05]
do GameState.request_attack.emit()
do GameState.ork_attack.emit()
Ork (roaring): MUUAAAAAAH! KRUM-NATAK!!!
do GameState.player_die.emit()
=> END


~ ork_negotiate
You: Easy… I don’t want to fight.

Ork (confused, growling): Hrr… nak? Zor-tha…?
*The ork hesitates, sniffing the air.*

- Lower your weapon => ork_negotiate_continue
- Stay silent => ork_negotiate_continue


~ ork_negotiate_continue
Ork (gruff, slower): …Grakh… no bash?
*He lowers his weapon slightly.*

Ork: Ur-nak cres… black steel… bad omen.
*He points at your armor and spits on the ground.*

- Nod slowly => ork_warning
- Speak calmly => ork_warning


~ ork_warning
do GameState.ork_back_default.emit()
Ork (serious): Krum-world sick. Black moon eat souls.
Ork (angry whisper): You walk death-road.

*The ork steps aside, letting you pass.*

do GameState.send_to_mother_1.emit()

=> END
